    <p class="ssb-problem">
      We noticed that many pre-retirees struggle to understand how their career earnings translate into a monthly Social Security check, often relying on rules of thumb or outdated estimates. We built this free tool because seniors deserve a fast, clear, plain English calculator to estimate their monthly check using official 2026 SSA bend points — without creating an account, providing an email, or logging into government portals.
